#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Set your geographical location. Open the <guilabel>Set Geographic Location</guilabel> window by selecting the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Geographic...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item, or by pressing the <guiicon>Globe</guiicon> icon in the toolbar, or by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>G</keycap></keycombo>."
